     6	2. Welfare mixtures: an episode-level lottery between the selected W0 attack and a profitable attack of the same rule at
     7	   the headline market (same frozen reference), with the largest W0 weight whose mean gain keeps a nonnegative one-sided
     8	   95 percent lower bound on the evaluation seeds. This checks whether the W1 policy class is closed under randomisation;
     9	   the weight is chosen on the evaluation seeds, so it is not an out-of-sample estimate.
    10	3. Q4 diagnostics per fresh market: the B3 - R3 gain difference split into its two terms, and R3's audit spending and
